"""Validate external metadata only; raw packet/frame bytes stay opaque."""
import json,re
MAX=2**62-1
HEX=re.compile(r'(?:[0-9a-fA-F]{2})*\Z',re.ASCII)
def pairs(items):
    out={}
    for k,v in items:
        if k in out:raise ValueError('duplicate decoded key')
        out[k]=v
    return out
